You know nothing of art. If you have to rely on AI to make a movie or anything else, it not only means you're lazy, but you have no creative bone in your body, and you suck. You will never be good at filmmaking and it takes no effort to make an AI generated film. It is literally easy as hell. 

Tell me, what AI generated movie is just as good as a real movie. Tell me, I'll wait.

